From 45de49a3b4f299cd60ee63903d8e8a31bbe0e0db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:46:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix light mode: readable hero terminal, glossary and privacy
 policy

- Hero terminal animation used fixed neon colours (1.3:1 contrast on the
  light terminal); it now uses theme-aware classes (~5:1 in light mode,
  unchanged neon in dark mode)
- Glossary and privacy policy hard-coded dark-theme colours (dark cards,
  pale grey text); switched to theme variables
- Glossary terms were squeezed into a 180px column by the shared sidebar
  grid; the page has no sidebar, so lay it out as a single column
- Add --accent-yellow (amber in light, yellow in dark) for warning text on
  concepts, workflow, quiz, AIOps and search
- Glossary count corrected from '100+' to '70+' (it has 72 terms)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Le4ebuVBvTqc4a3Q8F1Aj
